<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>GameVantage | Portal Berita Game Masa Depan</title>
    <style>
        /* Base Reset */
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; background: #f4f4f9; }

        /* Semantic Layout Styling */
        header { background: #1a1a2e; color: #fff; padding: 1rem 5%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 1000; border-bottom: 3px solid #e94560; }
        nav ul { display: flex; list-style: none; }
        nav ul li { margin-left: 20px; }
        nav ul li a { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; transition: 0.3s; }
        nav ul li a:hover { color: #e94560; }

        .container { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3fr 1fr; gap: 20px; padding: 20px 5%; max-width: 1400px; margin: auto; }

        /* Main Content - Articles */
        main h2 { margin-bottom: 20px; border-left: 5px solid #e94560; padding-left: 10px; }
        .featured-news { margin-bottom: 30px; position: relative; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: #000; height: 400px; }
        .featured-news img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.7; }
        .featured-news-text { position: absolute; bottom: 20px; left: 20px; color: white; right: 20px; }

        .news-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
        article { background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); transition: transform 0.3s; }
        article:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); }
        article img { width: 100%; height: 180px; object-fit: cover; }
        .article-content { padding: 15px; }
        .category { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #e94560; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .article-content h3 { margin: 10px 0; font-size: 1.2rem; }

        /* Sidebar */
        aside { background: #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; height: fit-content; }
        .trending-list { list-style: none; }
        .trending-list li { padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }
        .trending-list li span { color: #888; font-size: 0.9rem; }

        footer { background: #1a1a2e; color: #ccc; text-align: center; padding: 2rem; margin-top: 40px; }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header & Nav: Semantic Elements -->
    <header>
        <div class="logo"><h1>Game<span style="color:#e94560">Vantage</span></h1></div>
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">Hardware</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">Esports</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">Reviews</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Main Content Area -->
        <main>
            <section class="featured-news">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542751371-adc38448a05e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Esports Arena">
                <div class="featured-news-text">
                    <span class="category">Headline</span>
                    <h2>Revolusi Cloud Gaming 2026: Bermain Game AAA Tanpa Hardware Mahal</h2>
                    <p>Teknologi server terbaru memungkinkan latensi nol milidetik bagi pemain di seluruh dunia.</p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <h2>Berita Terbaru</h2>
            <div class="news-grid">
                <!-- Article 1 -->
                <article>
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550745165-9bc0b252726f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=60" alt="GPU Hardware">
                    <div class="article-content">
                        <span class="category">Hardware</span>
                        <h3>Performa 1440p Menjadi Standar Baru Gamer Menengah</h3>
                        <p>Analisis mendalam mengenai transisi resolusi layar di kalangan gamer tahun ini.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <!-- Article 2 -->
                <article>
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511512578047-dfb367046420?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=60" alt="AI Game Design">
                    <div class="article-content">
                        <span class="category">Teknologi</span>
                        <h3>Implementasi AI dalam NPC: Karakter Game Kini Bisa Berdialog Spontan</h3>
                        <p>Bagaimana kecerdasan buatan mengubah cara kita berinteraksi di dalam dunia open-world.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <!-- Article 3 -->
                <article>
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560253023-3ee5d6447644?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=60" alt="Mobile Gaming">
                    <div class="article-content">
                        <span class="category">Mobile</span>
                        <h3>Smartphone Gaming Kini Setara Konsol? Ini Faktanya</h3>
                        <p>Chipset mobile terbaru mampu menjalankan ray-tracing secara native tanpa overheat.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </main>

        <!-- Sidebar Area -->
        <aside>
            <h3>Trending Sekarang</h3>
            <ul class="trending-list">
                <li>
                    <span>#1</span>
                    <p>Rumor Konsol Generasi Terbaru "Project Nebula"</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span>#2</span>
                    <p>Update Patch Gede-gedean Game RPG Terpopuler</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span>#3</span>
                    <p>Turnamen World Championship Pecahkan Rekor Penonton</p>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </aside>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer Area -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 GameVantage Media. Dibuat dengan Semantic Web HTML5.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
